# Template Conventions

This project is a template. Before writing any utility, check this catalog.

## Base Classes

`presentation/base/activities/BaseActivity.kt`

```kotlin
class SampleActivity : BaseActivity<ActivitySampleBinding>(ActivitySampleBinding::inflate) {
    override fun getInsetsMode() = InsetsMode.TOP_BOTTOM   // optional
    override fun initSplashScreen() { installSplashScreen() }  // launcher activity only
    override fun onCreated() { /* views are ready, binding is set */ }
}
```

- Handles `enableEdgeToEdge()`, `setContentView`, and system bar insets.
- Never call `setContentView` yourself.

`presentation/base/fragments/BaseFragment.kt`

```kotlin
class FragmentSample : BaseFragment<FragmentSampleBinding>(FragmentSampleBinding::inflate) {
    override fun onViewInflated() { }   // optional, before onViewCreated
    override fun onViewCreated() { }    // required
}
```

- Owns and clears the binding. Never override `onCreateView` / `onDestroyView`.

## Helper Catalog (`helpers/`)

| Concern | File | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Navigation | `navigation/NavigationHelper.kt` | `navigateTo(currentId, directions)`, `popFrom(currentId)`, `isCurrentDestination(id)` |
| Lifecycle | `lifecycle/LifecycleHelper.kt` | `launchWhenCreated/Started/Resumed { }` |
| Double click | `listener/RapidSafeListener.kt` | `view.setOnRapidClickSafeListener { }`, toolbar variants |
| Back press | `ui/BackPressed.kt` | `goBackPressed { }` |
| Theme | `theme/ThemeHelper.kt` | `AppTheme.SYSTEM/LIGHT/DARK`, `applyAppTheme(mode)`, `themeTitleRes(mode)`, `isDarkThemeEnabled()` |
| Locale | `locale/LocaleHelper.kt` | `applyLanguage(code)` |
| System UI | `ui/SystemUIHelper.kt` | `statusBarColorUpdate(colorRes)`, `systemBarsIconsUpdate()`, keyboard show/hide, fullscreen |
| Toast | `ui/ToastingHelper.kt` | `showToast(msg)`, `showToast(stringRes)`, `showDebugToast(msg)` |
| Snackbar | `ui/SnackbarHelper.kt` | `showSnackBar(view, message)` |
| Dialogs | `dialogs/base/BaseDialog.kt`, `ui/DialogExtensions.kt` | `createAlertDialog(view)`, `createBottomSheet(view)`, `safeDialog { }`, `dialogWidth(0.9)` |
| Images | `ui/ImageHelper.kt` | `imageView.setImageFromUri/FilePath/Assets/Resource` (Glide) |
| Screen | `ui/ScreenHelper.kt` | `getScreenWidth()`, `getScreenHeight()` |
| Permissions | `permissions/PermissionHelper.kt` | `isLocationPermissionGranted()`, `isAudioPermissionGranted()`, `isGpsEnabled()` |
| Settings intents | `settings/SettingHelper.kt` | `rateUs()`, `shareApp()`, `support()`, `bugReport(text)`, `privacyPolicy()`, `openSettingPage()`, ... |
| Menus | `menu/MenuHelper.kt` | popup menu icon visibility and tinting |
| Date/Time | `datetime/DateTimeHelper.kt` | `getCurrentDate(format)` |
| Delay | `handlers/HandlerHelper.kt` | `withDelay(300) { }` |
| Misc | `utils/CommonUtils.kt` | `isActivityExist()`, `Int.isValidPosition(list)`, `String?.validateText()`, `getResString(id)` |
| Constants | `constants/IntentConstants.kt` | shared intent/bundle keys |

## Common (`common/`)

- `firebase/EventsProvider.kt`, `FirebaseUtils.kt` - `String.postFirebaseEvent()`, `Throwable.recordException(tag)`
- `firebase/RemoteConfiguration.kt` + `RemoteConstants.kt` - remote config keys and fetch
- `network/InternetManager.kt` - connectivity
- `observers/SingleLiveEvent.kt` - one-shot LiveData events
- `repository/`, `viewmodel/` - app-wide repositories and ViewModels

## Storage (`storage/`)

- `preferences/SharedPrefManager.kt` - single source of truth for preferences.
  Instantiate with `getSharedPreferences("app_preferences", MODE_PRIVATE)`.
  Add a new preference as a typed property with a private key constant. Never read raw
  `SharedPreferences` from a Fragment or ViewModel.
- `provider/` - bundled/static data providers.

## Adapters

`ListAdapter` + `DiffUtil`, ViewBinding in the ViewHolder, click callbacks through an interface in
the feature's `interfaces/` package. Follow `presentation/samples/language/adapters/AdapterLanguage.kt`.

## Dialogs

Inflate a ViewBinding, build with `createAlertDialog(...)` or `createBottomSheet(...)`, guard with
`safeDialog { }`, dismiss in the owning lifecycle callback.

## Sample Screens

`presentation/samples/` demonstrates bottom navigation, tab layout, ViewPager2, language switching,
location, permissions, Activity Result API, settings, dialogs, and double-click prevention.

Read the closest sample before implementing something similar. Do not modify a sample to make a new
feature work - copy the pattern into the new feature package.
